    "detailed_description": "The main mechanics of the game is the use of a grapple hook for movement. You will have a hook in each hand, allowing you not only to attach to surfaces and maneuver in the air, but also to do exciting stunts and accelerated jumps.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871150/extras/0c328498b1482d82303e4e3a0594f961.avif?t=1717705527\" width=600 height=161 /></span><br>Every biome in our game world will offer its own unique challenges, which require you to react quickly and accurately, and to put your skills to the test.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871150/extras/5badd0c856caa7380ab84b89c7987b04.avif?t=1717705527\" width=600 height=161 /></span><br>Our developers pay special attention to management so that you can fully immerse yourself in the gameplay. We provide intuitive and user-friendly controllers that will allow you to fully control your character's movements.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871150/extras/f4bada43a22644a679f848c851b4cec3.avif?t=1717705527\" width=600 height=161 /></span><br>Get Ready For Exciting Adventure! Fill This Flow!",
    "about_the_game": "The main mechanics of the game is the use of a grapple hook for movement. You will have a hook in each hand, allowing you not only to attach to surfaces and maneuver in the air, but also to do exciting stunts and accelerated jumps.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871150/extras/0c328498b1482d82303e4e3a0594f961.avif?t=1717705527\" width=600 height=161 /></span><br>Every biome in our game world will offer its own unique challenges, which require you to react quickly and accurately, and to put your skills to the test.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871150/extras/5badd0c856caa7380ab84b89c7987b04.avif?t=1717705527\" width=600 height=161 /></span><br>Our developers pay special attention to management so that you can fully immerse yourself in the gameplay. We provide intuitive and user-friendly controllers that will allow you to fully control your character's movements.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2871150/extras/f4bada43a22644a679f848c851b4cec3.avif?t=1717705527\" width=600 height=161 /></span><br>Get Ready For Exciting Adventure! Fill This Flow!",
